`@ngosangns/ns-bridge` bundles its own source tree into `dist/hosts/**`, and
ships those prebuilt host extensions for Pi, OMP, and the DeepSeek Harness.
The bundled sources include:

- `packages/pi-provider`, `packages/omp-provider*`, `packages/dsh-llm-*` —
  authored here, MIT.
- `packages/kiro-core`, ported from pi-provider-kiro
  (https://github.com/mikeyobrien/pi-provider-kiro), Copyright (c) Mike
  O'Brien, MIT. See the repository NOTICE for the full port description.
- `packages/devin-core`, ported from oh-my-pi
  (https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi), MIT.

`packages/pi-provider` carries its own NOTICE for the upstream projects it
adapts:

----
ns-pi-provider
